      "text": "\u2022 Real skin pores! \ud83d\ude31\n\u2022 Crisp HD wrinkles\n\u2022 Natural eye shine\n\u2022 512px photorealistic\n\u2022 MesoNet NOW FAILS!",
      "fontSize": 15,
